# (index.html + 02_Wireframes/, staged in the workflow) rather than the repo root,
# so a tracked file is no longer automatically downloadable from
# mattybotstew.github.io. It IS still readable on raw.githubusercontent.com, so
# ignoring is still the control that matters. See PROJECT_KNOWLEDGE_BASE.md §22.7.
clientDocs/
